{"about_the_game":"<strong>Town of Night</strong> is a First-Person Dungeon Crawler inspired by games like Shining in the Darkness, Etrian Odyssey, Diablo and Wizardry.<br>In Town of Night you play as Corr Algrimm. Hero, Scholar, ladies' man and expert Sword fighter - All self proclaimed.<br><br>Corr is visiting the Town of Night, a strange little town that makes money with Dungeon and Monster hunting tourism, to find out where the monsters are coming from.<br><br>In Town of Night you can recruit different members to your party to go dungeon crawling like you want to.<br>Remember to bring Ink and Paper to draw your own map and try not to die.<br><strong><br>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><br></li><li>    5-10 Hour Campaign<br></li><li>    6 Different Recrutable Heroes<br></li><li>    Looting and Levelling<br></li><li>    First Person Dungeon Crawling</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/546990?t=1479387047","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/546990?t=1479387047","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/546990/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1479387047","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/546990/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1479387047","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<strong>Town of Night</strong> is a First-Person Dungeon Crawler inspired by games like Shining in the Darkness, Etrian Odyssey, Diablo and Wizardry.<br>In Town of Night you play as Corr Algrimm. Hero, Scholar, ladies' man and expert Sword fighter - All self proclaimed.<br><br>Corr is visiting the Town of Night, a strange little town that makes money with Dunge